{"title": "Quant Super Practice — Mock #30", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>Find the value of (1 + cotA  -  cosecA)(1 + tanA + secA)  -  3(sin<sup>2</sup>A + cos<sup>2</sup>A).</p>", "q_hi": "<p>(1 + cotA - cosecA)(1 + tanA + secA) - 3(sin<sup>2</sup>A + cos<sup>2</sup>A) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["-1", "1", "2", "-2"], "options_hi": ["-1", "1", "2", "-2"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>(1 + cotA  -  cosecA)(1 + tanA + secA)  -  3(sin<sup>2</sup>A + cos<sup>2</sup>A)</p><p>= (1 + tanA + secA + cotA + cotA tanA + cotA secA  -  cosecA  -  cosecA tanA  -  cosecA secA)  -  3*1</p><p>= 1 + tanA + secA + cotA + 1 + cosecA  -  cosecA  -  secA  -  cosecA secA  -  3</p><p>= tanA + cotA  -  cosecA secA  -  1</p><p>= sinA/cosA + cosA/sinA  -  1/sinAcosA  -  1</p><p>= (sin<sup>2</sup>A + cos<sup>2</sup>A)/sinAcosA  -  1/sinAcosA  -  1</p><p>= 1/sinAcosA  -  1/sinAcosA  -  1</p><p>= -1</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(1 + cotA  -  cosecA)(1 + tanA + secA)  -  3(sin<sup>2</sup>A + cos<sup>2</sup>A)</p><p>= (1 + tanA + secA + cotA + cotA tanA + cotA secA  -  cosecA  -  cosecA tanA  -  cosecA secA)  -  3*1</p><p>= 1 + tanA + secA + cotA + 1 + cosecA  -  cosecA  -  secA  -  cosecA secA  -  3</p><p>= tanA + cotA  -  cosecA secA  -  1</p><p>= sinA/cosA + cosA/sinA  -  1/sinAcosA  -  1</p><p>= (sin<sup>2</sup>A + cos<sup>2</sup>A)/sinAcosA  -  1/sinAcosA  -  1</p><p>= 1/sinAcosA  -  1/sinAcosA  -  1</p><p>= -1</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If SinA + Sin<sup>2</sup>A=1, then the value of the expression (Cos<sup>2</sup>A + Cos<sup>4</sup>A) is _________.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; SinA + Sin<sup>2</sup>A=1, &#2340;&#2379; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; (Cos<sup>2</sup>A + Cos<sup>4</sup>A) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344;_____&#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["3/2", "1", "2", "1/2"], "options_hi": ["3/2", "1", "2", "1/2"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>SinA + Sin<sup>2</sup>A=1</p><p>SinA = 1- Sin<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>SinA = Cos<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>Cos<sup>2</sup>A + Cos<sup>4</sup>A</p><p>= Cos<sup>2</sup>A + (Cos<sup>2</sup>A)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= SinA + Sin<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>= 1</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>SinA + Sin<sup>2</sup>A=1</p><p>SinA = 1- Sin<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>SinA = Cos<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>Cos<sup>2</sup>A + Cos<sup>4</sup>A</p><p>= Cos<sup>2</sup>A + (Cos<sup>2</sup>A)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= SinA + Sin<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>= 1</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If &#945; + &#946; = 45&deg; and (tan &#945; + 1)(tan &#946; + 1) = 2x, then x is:</p>", "q_hi": "&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#945; + &#946; = 45&deg; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; (tan &#945; + 1)(tan &#946; + 1) = 2x, &#2340;&#2379; x &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?", "options_en": ["2", "-1", "0", "1"], "options_hi": ["2", "-1", "0", "1"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Expand: (tan &#945; + 1)(tan &#946; + 1) = tan &#945; tan &#946; + tan &#945; + tan &#946; + 1 = 2x.</p><p>Since &#945; + &#946; = 45&deg;, tan(&#945; + &#946;) = tan 45&deg; = 1.</p><p>tan(&#945; + &#946;) = (tan &#945; + tan &#946;)/(1 - tan &#945; tan &#946;) = 1 </p><p>tan &#945; + tan &#946; = 1 - tan &#945; tan &#946;.</p><p>Substitute: (tan &#945; tan &#946; + 1) + (tan &#945; + tan &#946;) = tan &#945; tan &#946; + 1 + (1 - tan &#945; tan &#946;) = 1 + 1 = 2.</p><p>So, 2x = 2 &rarr; x = 1.</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Expand: (tan &#945; + 1)(tan &#946; + 1) = tan &#945; tan &#946; + tan &#945; + tan &#946; + 1 = 2x.</p><p>Since &#945; + &#946; = 45&deg;, tan(&#945; + &#946;) = tan 45&deg; = 1.</p><p>tan(&#945; + &#946;) = (tan &#945; + tan &#946;)/(1 - tan &#945; tan &#946;) = 1 </p><p>tan &#945; + tan &#946; = 1 - tan &#945; tan &#946;.</p><p>Substitute: (tan &#945; tan &#946; + 1) + (tan &#945; + tan &#946;) = tan &#945; tan &#946; + 1 + (1 - tan &#945; tan &#946;) = 1 + 1 = 2.</p><p>So, 2x = 2 &rarr; x = 1.</p><p>Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the value of 3 sin 15&deg; - 4 sin<sup>3</sup> 15&deg; </p>", "q_hi": "3 sin 15&deg; - 4 sin<sup>3</sup> 15&deg; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;", "options_en": ["2", "1/2", "1/&radic;2", "&radic;2"], "options_hi": ["2", "1/2", "1/&radic;2", "&radic;2"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let &#952; = 15&deg;.</p><p>=&gt; sin3&#952; = sin(3  X  15&deg;) = sin45&deg;</p><p>=&gt; sin45&deg; = 1/&radic;2</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let &#952; = 15&deg;.</p><p>=&gt; sin3&#952; = sin(3  X  15&deg;) = sin45&deg;</p><p>=&gt; sin45&deg; = 1/&radic;2</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If cos&#8308;&#952; - sin&#8308;&#952; = 4/5, then find the value of sin4&#952;.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cos&#8308;&#952; - sin&#8308;&#952; = 4/5, &#2340;&#2379; sin4&#952; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["24/25", "21/25", "16/25", "18/25"], "options_hi": ["24/25", "21/25", "16/25", "18/25"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>cos&#8308;&#952; - sin&#8308;&#952; = 4/5</p><p>(cos&#178;&#952; - sin&#178;&#952;)(cos&#178;&#952; + sin&#178;&#952;) = 4/5</p><p>Since cos&#178;&#952; + sin&#178;&#952; = 1 and cos&#178;&#952; - sin&#178;&#952; = cos 2&#952; </p><p>cos 2&#952; = 4/5 </p><p>sin&#178; 2&#952; = 1 - cos&#178; 2&#952; </p><p>= 1 - (4/5)&#178; </p><p>= 1 - 16/25 </p><p>= 9/25 </p><p>sin 2&#952; = 3/5 </p><p>sin 4&#952; = 2 * sin 2&#952; * cos 2&#952; = 2 * (3/5) * (4/5) </p><p>sin 4&#952; = 24/25</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>cos&#8308;&#952; - sin&#8308;&#952; = 4/5</p><p>(cos&#178;&#952; - sin&#178;&#952;)(cos&#178;&#952; + sin&#178;&#952;) = 4/5</p><p>Since cos&#178;&#952; + sin&#178;&#952; = 1 and cos&#178;&#952; - sin&#178;&#952; = cos 2&#952; </p><p>cos 2&#952; = 4/5 </p><p>sin&#178; 2&#952; = 1 - cos&#178; 2&#952; </p><p>= 1 - (4/5)&#178; </p><p>= 1 - 16/25 </p><p>= 9/25 </p><p>sin 2&#952; = 3/5 </p><p>sin 4&#952; = 2 * sin 2&#952; * cos 2&#952; = 2 * (3/5) * (4/5) </p><p>sin 4&#952; = 24/25</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If tanA + sinA = x, tanA  -  sinA = y, what is the value of x<sup>2</sup>  -  y<sup>2</sup>?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; tanA + sinA = x, tanA - sinA = y, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["2&radic;(x/y)", "4&radic;(x/y)", "&radic;(xy)", "4&radic;(xy)"], "options_hi": ["2&radic;(x/y)", "4&radic;(x/y)", "&radic;(xy)", "4&radic;(xy)"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>x = tanA + sinA -----(1)</p><p>y = tanA  -  sinA -------(2)</p><p>Multiplying eqn(1) and (2)  - </p><p>xy = (tanA + sinA)(tanA  -  sinA)</p><p>xy = tan<sup>2</sup>A  -  sin<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>xy = sin<sup>2</sup>A/cos<sup>2</sup>A  -  sin<sup>2</sup>A*cos<sup>2</sup>A/cos<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>xy = (sin<sup>2</sup>A/cos<sup>2</sup>A)(1  -  cos<sup>2</sup>A)</p><p>xy = tan<sup>2</sup>Asin<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  y<sup>2</sup> = (x + y)(x  -  y)</p><p>= (tanA + sinA + tanA  -  sinA)( tanA + sinA  -  tanA + sinA)</p><p>= 4tanAsinA</p><p>= 4&radic;(xy)</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>x = tanA + sinA -----(1)</p><p>y = tanA  -  sinA -------(2)</p><p>Multiplying eqn(1) and (2)  - </p><p>xy = (tanA + sinA)(tanA  -  sinA)</p><p>xy = tan<sup>2</sup>A  -  sin<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>xy = sin<sup>2</sup>A/cos<sup>2</sup>A  -  sin<sup>2</sup>A*cos<sup>2</sup>A/cos<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>xy = (sin<sup>2</sup>A/cos<sup>2</sup>A)(1  -  cos<sup>2</sup>A)</p><p>xy = tan<sup>2</sup>Asin<sup>2</sup>A</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>  -  y<sup>2</sup> = (x + y)(x  -  y)</p><p>= (tanA + sinA + tanA  -  sinA)( tanA + sinA  -  tanA + sinA)</p><p>= 4tanAsinA</p><p>= 4&radic;(xy)</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Evaluate:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">3cos<sup>3</sup>&#952; - 2cos&#952;", "q_hi": "<p>&#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">3cos<sup>3</sup>&#952; - 2cos&#952;", "options_en": ["tan&#952;", "cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;", "cot&#952;", "tan<sup>2</sup>&#952;"], "options_hi": ["&#2340;&#2344;&#952;", "&#2326;&#2366;&#2335;<sup>2</sup>&#952;", "&#2326;&#2366;&#2335;&#952;", "&#2340;&#2344;<sup>2</sup>&#952;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Numerator: 3cos&ge;&#952; - 2cos&#952; = cos&#952; (3cos&#178;&#952; - 2) </p><p>Denominator: sin&#952; - 3sin&ge;&#952; = sin&#952; (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;) </p><p>Fraction = [cos&#952; (3cos&#178;&#952; - 2)] / [sin&#952; (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;)] </p><p>= cot&#952; [(3cos&#178;&#952; - 2) / (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;)] </p><p>= cot&#952; [(3(1 - sin&#178;&#952;) - 2) / (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;)] </p><p>= cot&#952; [(3 - 3sin&#178;&#952; - 2) / (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;)]</p><p>= cot&#952; [(1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;) / (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;)]</p><p>= cot&#952; </p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Numerator: 3cos&ge;&#952; - 2cos&#952; = cos&#952; (3cos&#178;&#952; - 2) </p><p>Denominator: sin&#952; - 3sin&ge;&#952; = sin&#952; (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;) </p><p>Fraction = [cos&#952; (3cos&#178;&#952; - 2)] / [sin&#952; (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;)] </p><p>= cot&#952; [(3cos&#178;&#952; - 2) / (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;)] </p><p>= cot&#952; [(3(1 - sin&#178;&#952;) - 2) / (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;)] </p><p>= cot&#952; [(3 - 3sin&#178;&#952; - 2) / (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;)]</p><p>= cot&#952; [(1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;) / (1 - 3sin&#178;&#952;)]</p><p>= cot&#952; </p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;Evaluate the given expression:&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">5", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">5", "options_en": ["0", "3", "5", "2"], "options_hi": ["0", "3", "5", "2"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>We have the expression as:-</p><p>5/(1+cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;)+3/(1+tan<sup>2</sup>&#952;)+2cos<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>We know that:-</p><p>1+cot<sup>2</sup>&#952; = cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952; , and 1 + tan<sup>2</sup>&#952; = sec<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>So after putting it in equation, we get:-</p><p>5/cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952; +3/sec<sup>2</sup>&#952; +2cos<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>= 5sin<sup>2</sup>&#952; + 3cos<sup>2</sup>&#952; + 2cos<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>=5 (as sin<sup>2</sup>&#952; + cos<sup>2</sup>&#952; =1)</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We have the expression as:-</p><p>5/(1+cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;)+3/(1+tan<sup>2</sup>&#952;)+2cos<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>We know that:-</p><p>1+cot<sup>2</sup>&#952; = cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952; , and 1 + tan<sup>2</sup>&#952; = sec<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>So after putting it in equation, we get:-</p><p>5/cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952; +3/sec<sup>2</sup>&#952; +2cos<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>= 5sin<sup>2</sup>&#952; + 3cos<sup>2</sup>&#952; + 2cos<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>=5 (as sin<sup>2</sup>&#952; + cos<sup>2</sup>&#952; =1)</p><p>Option (c) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If sec &#952; + tan &#952; = x, then find sin &#952;.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; sec &#952; + tan &#952; = x, &#2340;&#2379; sin &#952; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["(x<sup>2</sup> + 1)/(1  -  x<sup>2</sup>)", "(x<sup>2</sup>  -  1)/(1 + 2x<sup>2</sup>)", "(x<sup>2</sup>  -  1)/(1 + x<sup>2</sup>)", "(1  -  x<sup>2</sup>)/(1 + x<sup>2</sup>)"], "options_hi": ["(x<sup>2</sup> + 1)/(1  -  x<sup>2</sup>)", "(x<sup>2</sup>  -  1)/(1 + 2x<sup>2</sup>)", "(x<sup>2</sup>  -  1)/(1 + x<sup>2</sup>)", "(1  -  x<sup>2</sup>)/(1 + x<sup>2</sup>)"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>(sec &#952; + tan &#952;)(sec &#952;  -  tan &#952;) = sec&#178;&#952; - tan&#178;&#952; = 1</p><p>Substitute sec &#952; + tan &#952; = x:</p><p>x * (sec &#952;  -  tan &#952;) = 1</p><p>sec &#952;  -  tan &#952; = 1/x</p><p>(sec &#952; + tan &#952;) + (sec &#952;  -  tan &#952;) = x + 1/x</p><p>2sec&#952; = x + 1/x</p><p>sec &#952; = (x&#178; + 1)/2x</p><p>(sec &#952; + tan &#952;) - (sec &#952;  -  tan &#952;) = x - 1/x</p><p>2tan &#952; = x - 1/x</p><p>tan &#952; = (x&#178; - 1)/2x</p><p>sin&#178;&#952; = 1 - cos&#178;&#952;, where cos &#952; = 1/sec &#952;</p><p>cos &#952; = 2x/(x&#178; + 1)</p><p>sin&#178; &#952; = 1  -  [2x/(x&#178; + 1)]&#178;</p><p>sin&#178; &#952; = 1  -  [4x&#178;/(x&#178; + 1)&#178;]</p><p>sin&#178; &#952; = [(x&#178; + 1)&#178; - 4x&#178;)/(x&#178; + 1)&#178;</p><p>sin&#178; &#952; = (x&#8308; - 2x&#178; + 1)/(x&#178; + 1)&#178;</p><p>sin &#952; = [(x&#178; - 1)/(1 + x<sup>2</sup>)]</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(sec &#952; + tan &#952;)(sec &#952;  -  tan &#952;) = sec&#178;&#952; - tan&#178;&#952; = 1</p><p>Substitute sec &#952; + tan &#952; = x:</p><p>x * (sec &#952;  -  tan &#952;) = 1</p><p>sec &#952;  -  tan &#952; = 1/x</p><p>(sec &#952; + tan &#952;) + (sec &#952;  -  tan &#952;) = x + 1/x</p><p>2sec&#952; = x + 1/x</p><p>sec &#952; = (x&#178; + 1)/2x</p><p>(sec &#952; + tan &#952;) - (sec &#952;  -  tan &#952;) = x - 1/x</p><p>2tan &#952; = x - 1/x</p><p>tan &#952; = (x&#178; - 1)/2x</p><p>sin&#178;&#952; = 1 - cos&#178;&#952;, where cos &#952; = 1/sec &#952;</p><p>cos &#952; = 2x/(x&#178; + 1)</p><p>sin&#178; &#952; = 1  -  [2x/(x&#178; + 1)]&#178;</p><p>sin&#178; &#952; = 1  -  [4x&#178;/(x&#178; + 1)&#178;]</p><p>sin&#178; &#952; = [(x&#178; + 1)&#178; - 4x&#178;)/(x&#178; + 1)&#178;</p><p>sin&#178; &#952; = (x&#8308; - 2x&#178; + 1)/(x&#178; + 1)&#178;</p><p>sin &#952; = [(x&#178; - 1)/(1 + x<sup>2</sup>)]</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If (sin x + sin y) = a and (cos x + cos y) = b, then find the value of (sin x sin y + cos x cos y).</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (sin x + sin y) = a &#2324;&#2352; (cos x + cos y) = b, &#2340;&#2379; (sin x sin y + cos x cos y) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  1)/2", "(a<sup>2</sup>  -  b<sup>2</sup>  -  2)/2", "(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  2)/2", "(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + 2)/2"], "options_hi": ["(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  1)/2", "(a<sup>2</sup>  -  b<sup>2</sup>  -  2)/2", "(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  2)/2", "(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + 2)/2"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>(sin x + sin y) = a and (cos x + cos y) = b,</p><p>(sin x + sin y)<sup>2</sup> + (cos x + cos y)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup></p><p>sin<sup>2</sup> x + sin<sup>2</sup> y + 2sinxsiny + cos<sup>2</sup> x + cos<sup>2</sup> y + 2cosxcosy = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup></p><p>(sin<sup>2</sup> x + cos<sup>2</sup> x) + (sin<sup>2</sup> y + cos<sup>2</sup> y) + 2sinxsiny + 2cosxcosy = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup></p><p>1 + 1 + 2(sinxsiny + cosxcosy) = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup></p><p>2(sinxsiny + cosxcosy) = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  2</p><p>sinxsiny + cosxcosy = (a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  2)/2</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(sin x + sin y) = a and (cos x + cos y) = b,</p><p>(sin x + sin y)<sup>2</sup> + (cos x + cos y)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup></p><p>sin<sup>2</sup> x + sin<sup>2</sup> y + 2sinxsiny + cos<sup>2</sup> x + cos<sup>2</sup> y + 2cosxcosy = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup></p><p>(sin<sup>2</sup> x + cos<sup>2</sup> x) + (sin<sup>2</sup> y + cos<sup>2</sup> y) + 2sinxsiny + 2cosxcosy = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup></p><p>1 + 1 + 2(sinxsiny + cosxcosy) = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup></p><p>2(sinxsiny + cosxcosy) = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  2</p><p>sinxsiny + cosxcosy = (a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  2)/2</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">(sec &theta; - 1)<sup>n</sup>", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">(sec &theta; - 1)<sup>n</sup>", "options_en": ["1", "0.5", "-1", "-0.5"], "options_hi": ["1", "0.5", "-1", "-0.5"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p><img width=196 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image122.png\"></p><p><img width=264 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image123.png\"></p><p><img width=200 height=59 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image124.png\"></p><p><b>We know that:</b> sec<sup>2</sup> &#952;  -  1 = tan<sup>2</sup> &#952;</p><p><img width=200 height=59 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image125.png\"></p><p><img width=204 height=53 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image126.png\"></p><p><img width=213 height=45 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image127.png\"></p><p><img width=232 height=27 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image128.png\"></p><p>After comparing:</p><p>2n = 1</p><p>n = 0.5</p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=196 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image122.png\"></p><p><img width=264 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image123.png\"></p><p><img width=200 height=59 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image124.png\"></p><p><b>We know that:</b> sec<sup>2</sup> &#952;  -  1 = tan<sup>2</sup> &#952;</p><p><img width=200 height=59 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image125.png\"></p><p><img width=204 height=53 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image126.png\"></p><p><img width=213 height=45 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image127.png\"></p><p><img width=232 height=27 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image128.png\"></p><p>After comparing:</p><p>2n = 1</p><p>n = 0.5</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>The given expression is equal to: (cotB  -  tanB).sinB.cosB.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>(cotB - tanB).sinB.cosB</p>", "options_en": ["1  -  2sec<sup>2</sup>B", "1  -  2cos<sup>2</sup>B", "2cos<sup>2</sup>B - 1", "2sec<sup>2</sup>B - 1"], "options_hi": ["1 - 2sec<sup>2</sup>B", "1 - 2cos<sup>2</sup>B", "2cos<sup>2</sup>B - 1", "2sec<sup>2</sup>B - 1"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>(cotB  -  tanB).sinB.cosB</p><p>= (cosB/sinB  -  sinB/cosB).sinB.cosB</p><p>= [(cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  sin<sup>2</sup>B)/sinB.cosB].sinB.cosB</p><p>= (cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  sin<sup>2</sup>B)</p><p>= cos2B</p><p>= 1  -  2sin<sup>2</sup>B or 2cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  1</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(cotB  -  tanB).sinB.cosB</p><p>= (cosB/sinB  -  sinB/cosB).sinB.cosB</p><p>= [(cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  sin<sup>2</sup>B)/sinB.cosB].sinB.cosB</p><p>= (cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  sin<sup>2</sup>B)</p><p>= cos2B</p><p>= 1  -  2sin<sup>2</sup>B or 2cos<sup>2</sup>B  -  1</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the value of cosec&#952;(1 &#8722; cos&#952;)(cosec&#952; + cot&#952;).</p>", "q_hi": "<p>cosec&#952;(1 &#8722; cos&#952;)(cosec&#952; + cot&#952;) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["-1", "2", "0", "1"], "options_hi": ["-1", "2", "0", "1"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>cosec&#952;(1 &#8722; cos&#952;)(cosec&#952; + cot&#952;)</p><p>= (cosec&#952;  -  cot&#952;)(cosec&#952; + cot&#952;)</p><p>= cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952;  -  cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>= 1</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>cosec&#952;(1 &#8722; cos&#952;)(cosec&#952; + cot&#952;)</p><p>= (cosec&#952;  -  cot&#952;)(cosec&#952; + cot&#952;)</p><p>= cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952;  -  cot<sup>2</sup>&#952;</p><p>= 1</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If tanA + cotA = 2, then the value of tan<sup>2</sup> A + cot<sup>2</sup> A is:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; tanA + cotA = 2, &#2340;&#2379; tan<sup>2</sup> A + cot<sup>2</sup> A &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</p>", "options_en": ["16", "2", "8", "4"], "options_hi": ["16", "2", "8", "4"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Here, tanA + cotA = 2</p><p>So tanA + 1/tanA = 2</p><p>tan<sup>2</sup>A + 1 = 2tanA</p><p>tan<sup>2</sup>A  -  2tanA + 1 =0</p><p>(tanA  -  1 )<sup>2</sup>=0</p><p>tanA = 1</p><p>So, cotA =1</p><p>Now putting the values in tan<sup>2</sup> A + cot<sup>2</sup> A ;we have</p><p>1<sup>2</sup> + 1<sup>2</sup> = 2</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Here, tanA + cotA = 2</p><p>So tanA + 1/tanA = 2</p><p>tan<sup>2</sup>A + 1 = 2tanA</p><p>tan<sup>2</sup>A  -  2tanA + 1 =0</p><p>(tanA  -  1 )<sup>2</sup>=0</p><p>tanA = 1</p><p>So, cotA =1</p><p>Now putting the values in tan<sup>2</sup> A + cot<sup>2</sup> A ;we have</p><p>1<sup>2</sup> + 1<sup>2</sup> = 2</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If X =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2 sin &theta;", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; X = <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2 sin &theta;", "options_en": ["x/(1 + x)", "x", "1/x", "(1 + x)/x"], "options_hi": ["x/(1 + x)", "x", "1/x", "(1 + x)/x"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p><img width=124 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image101.png\"></p><p><img width=236 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image102.png\"></p><p><img width=159 height=48 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image103.png\"></p><p><img width=183 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image104.png\"></p><p><img width=196 height=51 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image105.png\"></p><p><img width=161 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image106.png\"></p><p><img width=159 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image107.png\"></p><p><img width=159 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image108.png\"></p><p><img width=123 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image109.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=124 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image101.png\"></p><p><img width=236 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image102.png\"></p><p><img width=159 height=48 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image103.png\"></p><p><img width=183 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image104.png\"></p><p><img width=196 height=51 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image105.png\"></p><p><img width=161 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image106.png\"></p><p><img width=159 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image107.png\"></p><p><img width=159 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image108.png\"></p><p><img width=123 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image109.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If x = a sec &#952; cos &#981;, y = b sec &#952; sin &#981; and z = c tan &#952;, then find the value of:</p><p></p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x<sup>2</sup>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;  x = a sec &#952; cos &#981;, y = b sec &#952; sin &#981;  &#2324;&#2352;   z = c tan &#952;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;  :</p><p></p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">x<sup>2</sup>", "options_en": ["2", "1", "3", "0"], "options_hi": ["2", "1", "3", "0"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Calculate each term:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x&#178;/a&#178; = sec&#178;&#952; cos&#178;&#981;</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;y&#178;/b&#178; = sec&#178;&#952; sin&#178;&#981;</p><p>So, x&#178;/a&#178; + y&#178;/b&#178; = sec&#178;&#952; (cos&#178;&#981; + sin&#178;&#981;) = sec&#178;&#952;</p><p>Also, z&#178;/c&#178; = tan&#178;&#952;</p><p>Thus, the expression becomes:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;sec&#178;&#952;  -  tan&#178;&#952;</p><p>Using the trigonometric identity:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;sec&#178;&#952;  -  tan&#178;&#952; = 1</p><p>option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Calculate each term:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;x&#178;/a&#178; = sec&#178;&#952; cos&#178;&#981;</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;y&#178;/b&#178; = sec&#178;&#952; sin&#178;&#981;</p><p>So, x&#178;/a&#178; + y&#178;/b&#178; = sec&#178;&#952; (cos&#178;&#981; + sin&#178;&#981;) = sec&#178;&#952;</p><p>Also, z&#178;/c&#178; = tan&#178;&#952;</p><p>Thus, the expression becomes:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;sec&#178;&#952;  -  tan&#178;&#952;</p><p>Using the trigonometric identity:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;sec&#178;&#952;  -  tan&#178;&#952; = 1</p><p>option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If cot&#952; = &radic;11, then the value of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952;  -  sec<sup>2</sup>&#952;", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; cot&#952; = &radic;11, &#2340;&#2379; <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">cosec<sup>2</sup>&#952;  -  sec<sup>2</sup>&#952;", "options_en": ["3/5", "5/6", "4/5", "6/7"], "options_hi": ["3/5", "5/6", "4/5", "6/7"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>We know that:-</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;cosec&#178;&#952; = 1 + cot&#178;&#952;</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;sec&#178;&#952; = 1 + tan&#178;&#952; = 1 + 1/cot&#178;&#952;</p><p>Given cot&#952; = &radic;11 &rarr; cot&#178;&#952; = 11, so:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;cosec&#178;&#952; = 1 + 11 = 12</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;sec&#178;&#952; = 1 + 1/11 = (11 + 1)/11 = 12/11</p><p>Now,</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;(cosec&#178;&#952;  -  sec&#178;&#952;) / (cosec&#178;&#952; + sec&#178;&#952;) = (12  -  (12/11)) / (12 + (12/11))</p><p>Multiply numerator and denominator by 11:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;= (132  -  12) / (132 + 12) = 120/144 = 5/6.</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We know that:-</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;cosec&#178;&#952; = 1 + cot&#178;&#952;</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;sec&#178;&#952; = 1 + tan&#178;&#952; = 1 + 1/cot&#178;&#952;</p><p>Given cot&#952; = &radic;11 &rarr; cot&#178;&#952; = 11, so:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;cosec&#178;&#952; = 1 + 11 = 12</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;sec&#178;&#952; = 1 + 1/11 = (11 + 1)/11 = 12/11</p><p>Now,</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;(cosec&#178;&#952;  -  sec&#178;&#952;) / (cosec&#178;&#952; + sec&#178;&#952;) = (12  -  (12/11)) / (12 + (12/11))</p><p>Multiply numerator and denominator by 11:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;= (132  -  12) / (132 + 12) = 120/144 = 5/6.</p><p>Option (b) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;If p =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">sin A", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; p =&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">sin A", "options_en": ["1/p", "1/(1&#8722;p)", "1/(p+1)", "p  -  1"], "options_hi": ["1/p", "1/(1&#8722;p)", "1/(p+1)", "p  -  1"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Start with the given:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;p = sin A / (1 + cos A).</p><p>Multiply numerator and denominator by (1  -  cos A):</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;p = [sin A (1  -  cos A)] / [(1 + cos A)(1  -  cos A)].</p><p>Use the identity (1 + cos A)(1  -  cos A) = 1 &#8722; cos&#178;A = sin&#178;A:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;p = [sin A (1  -  cos A)] / sin&#178;A.</p><p>Cancel sin A:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;p = (1  -  cos A) / sin A.</p><p>Taking reciprocals yields:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;1/p = sin A / (1  -  cos A).</p><p>Answer: sin A / (1  -  cos A) = 1/p</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Start with the given:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;p = sin A / (1 + cos A).</p><p>Multiply numerator and denominator by (1  -  cos A):</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;p = [sin A (1  -  cos A)] / [(1 + cos A)(1  -  cos A)].</p><p>Use the identity (1 + cos A)(1  -  cos A) = 1 &#8722; cos&#178;A = sin&#178;A:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;p = [sin A (1  -  cos A)] / sin&#178;A.</p><p>Cancel sin A:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;p = (1  -  cos A) / sin A.</p><p>Taking reciprocals yields:</p><p>&#8195;&#8195;1/p = sin A / (1  -  cos A).</p><p>Answer: sin A / (1  -  cos A) = 1/p</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;The value of (2 cos<sup>2</sup> &theta; - 1)[&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1 + tan &theta;", "q_hi": "<p><div>(2 cos<sup>2</sup> &#952; - 1)[ <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1 + tan &theta;", "options_en": ["2", "0", "&radic;3/2", "1"], "options_hi": ["2", "0", "&radic;3/2", "1"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p><img width=203 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image131.png\"></p><p><img width=251 height=55 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image132.png\"></p><p><img width=352 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image133.png\"></p><p><img width=179 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image134.png\"></p><p><img width=179 height=81 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image135.png\"></p><p><img width=219 height=81 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image136.png\"></p><p><img width=219 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image137.png\"></p><p><b>We know that: </b>cos 2&#952; = cos<sup>2</sup> &#952;  -  sin<sup>2</sup> &#952; = 2 cos<sup>2</sup> &#952;  -  1</p><p><img width=111 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image138.png\"></p><p><img width=25 height=16 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image139.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=203 height=41 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image131.png\"></p><p><img width=251 height=55 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image132.png\"></p><p><img width=352 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image133.png\"></p><p><img width=179 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image134.png\"></p><p><img width=179 height=81 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image135.png\"></p><p><img width=219 height=81 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image136.png\"></p><p><img width=219 height=47 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image137.png\"></p><p><b>We know that: </b>cos 2&#952; = cos<sup>2</sup> &#952;  -  sin<sup>2</sup> &#952; = 2 cos<sup>2</sup> &#952;  -  1</p><p><img width=111 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image138.png\"></p><p><img width=25 height=16 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p22215/image139.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If m + 5 = sec<sup>2</sup> A cosec<sup>2</sup> A(1  -  cos<sup>2</sup> A)(1  -  sin<sup>2</sup>A) + 5, then find the value of m : </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; m + 5 = sec<sup>2</sup> A cosec<sup>2</sup> A(1 - cos<sup>2</sup> A)(1 - sin<sup>2</sup>A) + 5, &#2340;&#2379; m &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:</p>", "options_en": ["10", "0", "1", "5"], "options_hi": ["10", "0", "1", "5"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>sec&#178;A = 1/cos&#178;A</p><p>cosec&#178;A = 1/sin&#178;A</p><p>1 - cos&#178;A = sin&#178;A</p><p>1 - sin&#178;A = cos&#178;A</p><p>m + 5 = sec&#178;A  X  cosec&#178;A  X  sin&#178;A  X  cos&#178;A + 5</p><p>Substitute sec&#178;A = 1/cos&#178;A and cosec&#178;A = 1/sin&#178;A:</p><p>m + 5 = (1/cos&#178;A)  X  (1/sin&#178;A)  X  sin&#178;A  X  cos&#178;A + 5</p><p>m + 5 = (1  X  cos&#178;A  X  sin&#178;A) / (cos&#178;A  X  sin&#178;A) + 5</p><p>m + 5 = 1 + 5</p><p>m + 5 = 6</p><p>m = 6  -  5 = 1</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>sec&#178;A = 1/cos&#178;A</p><p>cosec&#178;A = 1/sin&#178;A</p><p>1 - cos&#178;A = sin&#178;A</p><p>1 - sin&#178;A = cos&#178;A</p><p>m + 5 = sec&#178;A  X  cosec&#178;A  X  sin&#178;A  X  cos&#178;A + 5</p><p>Substitute sec&#178;A = 1/cos&#178;A and cosec&#178;A = 1/sin&#178;A:</p><p>m + 5 = (1/cos&#178;A)  X  (1/sin&#178;A)  X  sin&#178;A  X  cos&#178;A + 5</p><p>m + 5 = (1  X  cos&#178;A  X  sin&#178;A) / (cos&#178;A  X  sin&#178;A) + 5</p><p>m + 5 = 1 + 5</p><p>m + 5 = 6</p><p>m = 6  -  5 = 1</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}]}